{"seq":2,"slug":"constrained-optimization","title":"约束优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mathematical-optimization/nonlinear-metaheuristic/constrained-optimization","wordCount":1948,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"约束优化\">约束优化</h1><p>设计一架飞机的机翼，工程师要最小化阻力，但翼展不能超过跑道宽度、结构强度必须达标、油箱容积要够。这些「不能越界」的限制就是约束，它们让问题从<a href=\"gradient-newton-methods\">梯度法与牛顿法</a>处理的自由下降，变成了「在一堵墙围起来的区域里找最低点」。当约束是非线性的，简单地往下走可能直接撞墙——可行域的边界成了必须时刻顾及的对象。本篇讲清处理非线性约束的三大算法族，它们的共同灵魂是<a href=\"../foundations/duality-kkt\">对偶与 KKT 条件</a>：约束优化的数值方法，本质都是在求解 KKT 方程组。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>带约束的非线性优化问题写作：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>x</mi></munder><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>s.t.</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min_x f(x) \\quad \\text{s.t.}\\quad g_i(x)\\le 0,\\; h_j(x)=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.45em;vertical-align:-0.7em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s.t.</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>与无约束情形的关键区别在于，最优解可能不在「梯度为零」的地方，而在约束的边界上——目标想继续下降，却被约束顶住了。这正是 KKT 条件平稳性方程的几何含义：在最优解处，目标的负梯度恰好是各起作用约束梯度的非负线性组合，即下降的欲望与约束的阻力达成平衡。</p>\n<p>处理约束的算法大致分两条哲学路线。一条是「把约束化掉」——通过惩罚或障碍把约束问题转成一系列无约束问题，复用<a href=\"gradient-newton-methods\">梯度法与牛顿法</a>的成熟机器。另一条是「直接面对约束」——在每步迭代里显式处理约束，如序列二次规划。两条路线各有擅长的场景。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[约束优化问题] --&gt; B[路线一: 化为无约束]&#10;    A --&gt; C[路线二: 直接处理约束]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[罚函数法&lt;br/&gt;违反约束就惩罚]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[增广拉格朗日&lt;br/&gt;罚项+乘子]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[内点障碍法&lt;br/&gt;从内部逼近边界]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[序列二次规划 SQP&lt;br/&gt;反复解二次子问题]&#10;    B1 --&gt; D[每步复用无约束求解器]&#10;    C1 --&gt; E[每步逼近 KKT 系统]\">graph TD\n    A[约束优化问题] --&gt; B[路线一: 化为无约束]\n    A --&gt; C[路线二: 直接处理约束]\n    B --&gt; B1[罚函数法&lt;br/&gt;违反约束就惩罚]\n    B --&gt; B2[增广拉格朗日&lt;br/&gt;罚项+乘子]\n    B --&gt; B3[内点障碍法&lt;br/&gt;从内部逼近边界]\n    C --&gt; C1[序列二次规划 SQP&lt;br/&gt;反复解二次子问题]\n    B1 --&gt; D[每步复用无约束求解器]\n    C1 --&gt; E[每步逼近 KKT 系统]</pre><p>下表对比三大算法族的核心机制与适用场景：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>核心机制</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>罚函数法</td>\n<td>违反约束加惩罚项</td>\n<td>实现简单</td>\n<td>病态、难精确满足约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增广拉格朗日</td>\n<td>罚项 + 显式乘子估计</td>\n<td>避免罚因子趋无穷</td>\n<td>需更新乘子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内点障碍法</td>\n<td>对数障碍从内部逼近</td>\n<td>大规模高效、理论好</td>\n<td>须有可行内点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>序列二次规划 SQP</td>\n<td>反复解二次近似</td>\n<td>收敛快、约束精确</td>\n<td>每步代价高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"罚函数与障碍-把约束揉进目标\">罚函数与障碍：把约束揉进目标</h2><p>最直观的处理约束方式是惩罚违规。罚函数法在目标里加一项，只要违反约束就让目标变大，从而把约束「劝退」。一个常见的二次罚函数是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(x,\\rho) = f(x) + \\rho \\left( \\sum_i \\max(0, g_i(x))^2 + \\sum_j h_j(x)^2 \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1638em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">(</span></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>罚因子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 越大，对违规的惩罚越狠，最优解越贴近可行域。理论上 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho\\to\\infty</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span></span></span></span></span> 时收敛到真解，但这带来一个致命问题——大 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 让问题变得极度病态（条件数爆炸），无约束求解器难以收敛。</p>\n<p>增广拉格朗日法巧妙地化解了这个困境。它在罚项之外再加入对拉格朗日乘子的显式估计，每轮交替地求解无约束子问题、再更新乘子估计。乘子承担了「精确满足约束」的责任，罚因子就不必趋于无穷，避免了病态。这正是把<a href=\"../foundations/duality-kkt\">对偶与 KKT 条件</a>里的乘子直接搬进算法的体现。</p>\n<p>障碍法走的是相反方向——它不惩罚违规，而是阻止迭代点接近边界。对数障碍 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\mu\\sum_i \\log(-g_i(x))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span> 在逼近不等式约束边界时趋于正无穷，像一道无形的墙把迭代点关在可行域内部。障碍参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 从大到小递减，迭代点沿中心路径逼近真正的最优边界点。这就是内点法的核心思想，它在<a href=\"../linear-integer/linear-programming-simplex\">线性规划与单纯形</a>里已用于 LP，在这里推广到一般凸约束优化，是大规模约束优化的工业主力。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[选罚/障碍因子初值] --&gt; B[求解当前无约束子问题]&#10;    B --&gt; C[得到子问题最优解]&#10;    C --&gt; D{约束满足精度达标?}&#10;    D --&gt;|否, 罚法| E[增大罚因子 rho]&#10;    D --&gt;|否, 障碍法| F[减小障碍参数 mu]&#10;    D --&gt;|否, 增广法| G[更新乘子估计]&#10;    E --&gt; B&#10;    F --&gt; B&#10;    G --&gt; B&#10;    D --&gt;|是| H[收敛, 输出解]\">flowchart TD\n    A[选罚/障碍因子初值] --&gt; B[求解当前无约束子问题]\n    B --&gt; C[得到子问题最优解]\n    C --&gt; D{约束满足精度达标?}\n    D --&gt;|否, 罚法| E[增大罚因子 rho]\n    D --&gt;|否, 障碍法| F[减小障碍参数 mu]\n    D --&gt;|否, 增广法| G[更新乘子估计]\n    E --&gt; B\n    F --&gt; B\n    G --&gt; B\n    D --&gt;|是| H[收敛, 输出解]</pre><h2 id=\"序列二次规划-每步解一个小问题\">序列二次规划：每步解一个小问题</h2><p>序列二次规划 SQP 是处理一般非线性约束最有力的方法之一，思路是「以简驭繁」——在当前点用一个二次规划子问题去局部逼近原问题，解出搜索方向，走一步，再逼近，反复迭代。</p>\n<p>具体地，SQP 在每个迭代点把目标用二次模型近似（用拉格朗日函数的 Hessian），把约束用线性模型近似，得到一个<a href=\"../foundations/convex-optimization\">二次规划</a> QP 子问题。这个 QP 比原问题简单得多、有成熟解法。解出的方向带着对约束曲率的考量，因此 SQP 能精确满足非线性约束、收敛快（局部超线性甚至二次）。</p>\n<p>SQP 本质上是把牛顿法用到 KKT 方程组上——它在直接求解最优性条件，而非绕道无约束子问题。代价是每步要解一个 QP、要维护拉格朗日 Hessian（常用拟牛顿近似），计算较重。它在中小规模、约束高度非线性、要求约束精确满足的场景（如航空航天轨迹优化、机器人控制）里是首选。</p>\n<p>实践中三大算法族并非互斥：内点法擅长大规模、SQP 擅长高精度小规模、增广拉格朗日在二者之间且对病态稳健。现代非线性求解器如 IPOPT（内点）、SNOPT（SQP）各占一方，选型取决于问题规模、约束性质与精度要求，详见<a href=\"../practice/modeling-solvers\">建模语言与求解器</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"约束的处理决定可行性\">约束的处理决定可行性</h2><p>约束优化里有一类无约束优化不存在的核心难题——可行性。算法不仅要让目标下降，还要让解满足所有约束，二者常常冲突。一个解可能目标很优却违反约束（不可行），也可能严格可行却目标很差。如何平衡这对矛盾，是约束优化算法设计的中心。</p>\n<p>不同算法对可行性的态度迥异。内点法要求迭代全程严格可行（始终在可行域内部），因此必须先找到一个可行起点——这本身有时就是个难题。罚函数法允许迭代过程违反约束、只在收敛时逼近可行，更灵活但收敛末期约束满足可能不够精确。SQP 介于其间。</p>\n<p>投影是处理简单约束（如边界、线性约束）的另一利器：每走一步就把迭代点投影回可行域。投影梯度法对带简单约束的问题极为高效，是许多机器学习约束问题（如非负矩阵分解、带范数约束的训练）的常用手段。当约束复杂到投影本身都难算时，才需要上面的通用方法。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>可行性策略</th>\n<th>代表方法</th>\n<th>迭代是否始终可行</th>\n<th>适用约束</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内部可行</td>\n<td>内点障碍法</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>一般凸约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>末期可行</td>\n<td>罚函数法</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>一般约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>投影回可行域</td>\n<td>投影梯度法</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>简单约束（边界/线性）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子问题保可行</td>\n<td>SQP</td>\n<td>近似</td>\n<td>非线性约束</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>约束优化的最优解常在约束边界上，由 KKT 平稳性刻画——目标下降欲望与约束阻力达成平衡。</li>\n<li>罚函数法违规即惩罚但易病态；增广拉格朗日加入乘子估计避免罚因子趋无穷；内点障碍法从可行域内部逼近，是大规模主力。</li>\n<li>序列二次规划 SQP 每步解一个二次子问题，本质是把牛顿法用于 KKT 方程组，收敛快、约束精确，适合高精度中小规模问题。</li>\n<li>可行性是约束优化的核心难题：内点法全程可行、罚法末期可行、投影法把解拉回可行域，选择取决于约束性质。</li>\n<li>本篇是<a href=\"gradient-newton-methods\">梯度法与牛顿法</a>在有约束下的延伸，理论根基是<a href=\"../foundations/duality-kkt\">对偶与 KKT 条件</a>，求解器实现见<a href=\"../practice/modeling-solvers\">建模语言与求解器</a>；当问题非凸不可导时转向<a href=\"metaheuristics\">元启发式</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"约束优化","id":"约束优化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"罚函数与障碍：把约束揉进目标","id":"罚函数与障碍-把约束揉进目标"},{"level":2,"text":"序列二次规划：每步解一个小问题","id":"序列二次规划-每步解一个小问题"},{"level":2,"text":"约束的处理决定可行性","id":"约束的处理决定可行性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"梯度法与牛顿法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mathematical-optimization/nonlinear-metaheuristic/gradient-newton-methods"},"next":{"title":"元启发式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mathematical-optimization/nonlinear-metaheuristic/metaheuristics"}}